لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ","position":74,"translation":"*","code_v4":"ﲒ"},{"type":"ayah_end","html":"١٠٢","code_v4":"ﲓ"}],"meaning":"他们遵随众恶魔对于素莱曼的国权所宣读的诬蔑言论——素莱曼没有叛道，众恶魔却叛道了——他们教人魔术，并将巴比伦的两个天使哈鲁特和马鲁特所得的魔术教人。他们俩在教授任何人之前，必说：“我们只是试验，故你不可叛道。”他们就从他们俩学了可以离间夫妻的魔术，但不得安拉的许可，他们绝不能用魔术伤害任何人。他们学了对于自己有害而无益的东西。他们确已知道谁购取魔术，谁在后世绝无福分。他们只以此出卖自己，这代价真恶劣！假若他们知道。"},{"surah":2,"ayah":103,"tokens":[{"type":"word","html":"وَلَوْ","position":1,"translation":"假如","code_v4":"ﲔ"},{"type":"word","html":"أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ","position":2,"translation":"他们","code_v4":"ﲕ"},{"type":"word","html":"ءَامَنُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed>","position":3,"translation":"归信","code_v4":"ﲖ"},{"type":"word","html":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّقَوْ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed>","position":4,"translation":"并敬畏","code_v4":"ﲗ"},{"type":"word","html":"لَمَثُوبَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٌ</tajweed>","position":5,"translation":"必定有报酬","code_v4":"ﲘ"},{"type":"word","html":"<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>م</tajweed>ِّنْ","position":6,"translation":"来自","code_v4":"ﲙ"},{"type":"word","html":"عِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>ِ","position":7,"translation":"*","code_v4":"ﲚ"},{"type":"word","html":"<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ","position":8,"translation":"安拉","code_v4":"ﲛ"},{"type":"word","html":"خَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>رٌ‌ۖ</tajweed>","position":9,"translation":"更好","code_v4":"ﲜﲝ"},{"type":"word","html":"<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ل</tajweed>َّوْ","position":10,"translation":"假如","code_v4":"ﲞ"},{"type":"word","html":"كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed>","position":11,"translation":"他们知道","code_v4":"ﲟ"},{"type":"word","html":"يَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ","position":12,"translation":"*","code_v4":"ﲠ"},{"type":"ayah_end","html":"١٠٣","code_v4":"ﲡ"}],"meaning":"假若他们归信，而且敬畏，那么，从安拉那里降下的报酬，必是更好的；假若他们知道。"},{"surah":2,"ayah":104,"tokens":[{"type":"word","html":"يَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</ta